cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Water Storage Site Finder"
abstract: >-
  Open-data web tool that screens locations for storage dams and water-harvesting
  structures anywhere in the world: catchment delineation, rainfall-runoff, floods,
  sediment, evaporation, dam-height scenarios, land cover and hazards, with a 0-100
  feasibility score and a PDF report.
authors:
  - family-names: "Ahmad"
    given-names: "Junaid"
version: "1.6"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - hydrology
  - dams
  - water harvesting
  - site screening
  - GIS
  - open data
